        "original_id": "d6785e47-15c7-5934-b5f0-82b9d55410ef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Secretariat; The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band; \"It's Who You Are\"\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures; Walt Disney Productions\n- People: Mike Rich; Sheldon Turner; Nick Glennie-Smith; Randall Wallace; Laura Bower Van Nuys; Michael O'Herlihy; Sherman Brothers; AJ Michalka\n- Topics: film production; film music; theme songs\n\nFacts:\n- The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band is a 1968 American musical film from Walt Disney Productions.\n- The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band was based on a biography by Laura Bower Van Nuys.\n- The One and Only, Genuine, Original Family Band was directed by Michael O'Herlihy and had original music and lyrics by the Sherman Brothers.\n- Secretariat is a 2010 American biographical sports drama film produced and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Secretariat was written by Mike Rich and Sheldon Turner, directed by Randall Wallace, and featured music by Nick Glennie-Smith.\n- AJ Michalka recorded the theme song and accompanying music video for Secretariat, titled \"It's Who You Are.\"",
